# DJI Cloud API project rule

For DJI Cloud API, Pilot 2, Dock, MQTT, livestream, wayline, media, firmware,
WebSocket, JSBridge, or WPML work, apply the installed `dji-cloud-api` Skill,
or read `skills/dji-cloud-api/SKILL.md` when it is not installed. That file is
the single source for lookup, authentication, safety, and retry instructions.
Do not duplicate or override those policies here.
